<title>SPAIN: Telefonica appoints Fernando Abril CFO.</title>
<headline>Telefonica appoints Fernando Abril CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish telecommunications group Telefonica de Espana said on Wednesday it had appointed Fernando Abril Hernandez as director of corporate finance and a member of the company's management committee.</p>
<p>Abril, 34, has been treasury director and a member of the management committee of J.P. Morgan in Spain.</p>
<p>Sources at the group confirmed the appointment to Reuters last week.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
